teacher_info.introduction:
My work background is in Communications and I currently work as a freelance writer and English tutor. I am available to help persons who wish to: 
- improve their English through natural conversation; 
- improve their pronunciation and grammar; 
- work on writing and speaking practice for IELTS; 
- practice for job interviews; 
- or receive help with writing tasks (emails, reports, applications, essays, etc.).
For students who need help with writing tasks longer than 500 words, please message me before booking a session. 

I am not a teacher, neither am I offering teaching services - instead I am available to help you practice what you are already learning.
My schedule is flexible, so let me know what times are best for you, and we can practice via Skype, QQ, FaceTime or Google Hangouts.

