teacher_info.teaching_style:
The ingredients of my lessons are:

- MULTIMEDIA TOOLS
video and audio files (interviews, songs, podcasts), newspaper articles, short stories etc;

- "LEARNING BY DOING" METHOD
starting from practice I come up with theory, like children you will learn first to speak and then you will study the grammar;

- LOVE FOR ITALIAN CULTURE
language and culture go hand in hand, the first would not exist without the second, I try to make you smile a with anecdotes and curiosities of my beautiful country;

- SHARING
the lessons are not only a learning moment but they are also an encounter between my culture and yours, an opportunity to share your experiences to me and viceversa.

